{"availability":"available","full":"Akshaykeenath/MERN_video_streamer","name":"MERN_video_streamer","description":"🎥 Experience an interactive video-streaming platform driven by the MERN stack. Seamlessly upload, view, analyze, and explore trending content. Crafted with Material UI and integrated with Firebase, our application empowers users to share their videos and offers insightful analytics for content performance evaluation.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":6,"forks":4,"created":"2023-10-21T06:37:56Z","updated":"2024-01-03T15:29:17Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ketube.netlify.app/","topics":["express","mern-stack","mongodb-database","node","react","web-application"],"demo":"https://ketube.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T13:20:45.874Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T13:20:45.874Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T13:20:45.874Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T13:20:45.874Z","stars":6,"forks":4}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Welcome to the MERN Video Streamer, a comprehensive video streaming application developed using the MERN stack. This platform provides users with the ability to upload and share their videos seamlessly. Whether you're a content creator, viewer, or both, this application offers a rich set of features to enhance your video streaming experience."],"features":["Video Uploading: Users can effortlessly upload their videos for the world to see.","Performance Analytics: Video owners have access to detailed performance analytics presented through intuitive graphs. Metrics such as view count, likes, and dislikes variations are readily available.","Trending Videos: Discover the latest and most engaging videos with the trending section, showcasing content with the highest reactions.","Subscription System: Users can subscribe to their favorite channels, ensuring they never miss out on new content.","Home Screen Accessibility